  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div id=\"__next\"><p><a href=\"#content\"><span>Skip to main content</span></a></p><nav id=\"sticky-nav\" aria-label=\"Sticky Nav\"></nav><div><main id=\"content\"><div><article><div><div><p>An upgrade to Gemini 3.1 lets Google’s smart home assistant handle multiple requests in the same voice command.</p></div><div><div><p>An upgrade to Gemini 3.1 lets Google’s smart home assistant handle multiple requests in the same voice command.</p><div><p><span><span>by</span> <!-- --> <span aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span id=\"follow-author-author_byline_lead-dmcyOmF1dGhvclByb2ZpbGU6ODAzMzIw\"><span><span><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 9 9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-label=\"Follow\"><path d=\"M5 0H4V4H0V5H4V9H5V5H9V4H5V0Z\"></path></svg></span></span><span>Stevie Bonifield</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><time datetime=\"2026-05-05T21:46:04+00:00\">May 5, 2026, 9:46 PM UTC</time></span></p></div></div><div><div><p><img alt=\"An image of a Google Nest Hub.\" data-chromatic=\"ignore\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 700px\" srcset=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/23028907/dseifert_20210323_4485_0004.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=376 376w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/23028907/dseifert_20210323_4485_0004.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=384 384w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/23028907/dseifert_20210323_4485_0004.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=415 415w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/23028907/dseifert_20210323_4485_0004.jpg?quality=